WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.700
Physics knows just four
fundamental interactions:

2
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:08.070
strong, electromagnetic,
weak and gravitational.

3
00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:11.030
The strong interaction
is the strongest of all,

4
00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:14.590
yet it reaches only about the
width of a nucleon or two.

5
00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:19.190
Gravity reaches out without limit,
yet it is by far the weakest.

6
00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:23.750
And neutrinos stream straight through
the whole Earth, barely touched.

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:27.200
So which interactions does
a particle actually feel?

8
00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:28.780
And how can you tell?

9
00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:33.820
In this mission, you'll rank the four
interactions by strength and by range.

10
00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:37.960
Then you'll find out why neutrinos
slip through the Earth so easily.

11
00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:42.760
Your mission: work out which
interactions a particle feels, and why.
